flowchart TD
  classDef works fill:#1d2029,stroke:#555b68,color:#eceef1;
  classDef friction fill:#262a34,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:2px,color:#eceef1;
  classDef broken fill:#1d2029,stroke:#d77757,stroke-width:2px,color:#d77757;
  classDef byhand fill:#1d2029,stroke:#eceef1,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray:4 3,color:#eceef1;
  S1["1. The Claude tab says what is needed: 'needs<br/>Claude Code's status line feed', 'one<br/>statusLine entry in ~/.claude/settings.json',<br/>'chained if one exists', and one button,<br/>Install the status line entry.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S2["2. With a status line of your own it says 'your<br/>current status line is kept and chained'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S3["3. Install writes one statusLine entry with<br/>refreshInterval 5 and keeps every other key; an<br/>existing entry keeps its padding and a<br/>refreshInterval of 5 or less and is chained.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S4["4. The windows then read 'no session yet open<br/>Claude Code once'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S5["5. During the first call both windows and the<br/>session say 'waiting for the first reply'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S6["6. After the first reply: 'Live from Claude Code',<br/>the windows with pace, each session with its<br/>bar.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S7["7. A settings.json that is not valid JSON, or<br/>valid JSON that is not an object: Install says<br/>why under the button, wrapped, on the Claude<br/>tab and in Settings.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S8["8. Both places name the button 'Install the status<br/>line entry', and no line runs past the panel<br/>edge.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S9["9. Several settings folders each get their own<br/>script and backup; a folder with only<br/>transcripts is left alone; a lost script offers<br/>Install again.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S10["10. A settings.json that is a link stays a link,<br/>and the file it names keeps its mode; a created<br/>settings.json is 0600.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S11["11. disableAllHooks on: 'disableAllHooks is on in<br/>settings.json so Claude Code runs no status<br/>line'.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
  S12["12. An entry installed by an earlier version gets<br/>the current script at the next launch, its<br/>chained command kept.<br/><i>works</i>"]:::works
